        "theme":  "Enterprise",
        "summary":  "Roche CDTO Wafaa Mamilli outlines how the pharma giant achieves AI outcomes by prioritizing data quality, governance, and workforce upskilling over chasing the latest technology. Real-world applications include kidney disease risk algorithms, AI-powered manager coaching tools, digital pathology for cancer detection, and manufacturing digital twins that cut development cycles by two to four times. Mamilli restructured the technology organization to create separate Chief AI Officer and Chief Data Officer roles, reflecting her belief that \u0027data structured and ready\u0027 is the foundational prerequisite for AI success.",
